# A merge-group CI job's wall-time budget is 20 minutes (helpers/job-budget.py, milestone 721 (each merge-group CI job has a 20-minute budget)).
# A job that must exceed it gets a line here, in the same diff that lets it grow:
#
#     <job> <minutes> <reason, in words>
#
# `check` reads the minutes as that job's budget, warns at 75% of it and fails above it.
# `timeout-minutes` in ci.yml may then be at most the new budget plus five. A line with no reason is
# refused, and so is one that does not raise the budget above 20. No job has one today: on 2026-10-03
# the slowest, `cpu-matrix`, ran a 15.0 minute median and a 16.6 minute maximum.
